      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1. 怎样用实验表明，机械能可以从一种形式转化为另一",
        "种形式？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "2",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "2. 当一个钢球和一块钢板碰撞时，发生了哪些能量",
        "转化？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "练习 40"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "(1) 将下列各情况中所发生的能量转化指出来：",
        "$\\textcircled{1}$ 瀑布的水往下流；",
        "$\\textcircled{2}$ 将球竖直向上抛出；",
        "$\\textcircled{3}$ 将手表的游丝拧紧；",
        "$\\textcircled{4}$ 前述的关于弹簧门的例子."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "2",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "(2) 几个落体的质量都相同，那么它们在同一高度时的势能的大",
        "小是否相同？在这个高度上它们动能的大小是否相同？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "3",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "(3) 试举出一些既具有动能又同时具有势能的物体的例子."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
